ng.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1776548759644-5da0988a7874?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w5MzQzMTh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxPZmZpY2UlMjBDaGFpciUyMEJhY2slMjBTdXBwb3J0fGVufDB8fHx8MTc3NzA1MjQyMXww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080',_binary '\0','PALO Orthopedic Long Back Support with Memory Foam',1269,NULL,93,'2026-04-24 17:40:22.167868',6),(37,_binary '','2026-04-24 17:40:22.711948','U-shaped travel neck pillow with a washable velvet cover and premium memory foam cushion. Provides excellent 360-degree neck support for airplane and car travel.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1706819399603-428b06afe3fc?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w5MzQzMTh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxUcmF2ZWwlMjBOZWNrJTIwUGlsbG93fGVufDB8fHx8MTc3NzA1MjQyMnww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080',_binary '\0','PALO Premium Memory Foam Travel Neck Pillow',679,NULL,110,'2026-04-24 17:40:22.711948',6),(38,_binary '','2026-04-24 17:40:23.294524','Adjustable under-desk footrest made of High Impact Polystyrene. Helps improve posture and blood circulation by keeping feet and legs elevated while working.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586543354109-ed9d03c5f49c?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w5MzQzMTh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxVbmRlciUyMERlc2slMjBGb290cmVzdHxlbnwwfHx8fDE3NzcwNTI0MjN8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080',_binary '\0','PALO Footrest',1649,NULL,148,'2026-04-24 17:40:23.294524',6),(39,_binary '','2026-04-24 17:40:24.471084','Lumbar support backrest featuring a secure adjustable strap to fit any office chair. Molded memory foam provides targeted relief to the lower spine.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1653179767373-8cba51333cfe?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w5MzQzMTh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxMdW1iYXIlMjBTdXBwb3J0JTIwQ3VzaGlvbnxlbnwwfHx8fDE3NzcwNTI0MjR8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080',_binary '\0','PALO Premium Ergonomic Backrest with Memory Foam',1269,NULL,29,'2026-04-24 17:40:24.471084',6),(40,_binary '','2026-04-24 17:40:25.039122','Easily convert your standard desk into a healthy sit-stand workstation. Features a smooth gas-spring height adjustment mechanism and a wide tray for dual monitors.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605543123001-e33188b556c9?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w5MzQzMTh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxTdGFuZGluZyUyMERlc2slMjBDb252ZXJ0ZXJ8ZW58MHx8fHwxNzc3MDUyNDI0fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080',_binary '\0','Adjustable Standing Desk Converter',5499,NULL,68,'2026-04-24 17:40:25.039122',6),(41,_binary '','2026-04-24 17:40:25.938086','High-density eco-friendly TPE yoga mat. 6mm thickness offers comfortable cushioning for joints. Features a double-sided non-slip texture for excellent traction.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1646239646963-b0b9be56d6b5?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w5MzQzMTh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxZb2dhJTIwTWF0fGVufDB8fHx8MTc3NzA1MjQyNXww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080',_binary '\0','ProGrip Non-Slip Yoga Mat 6mm',899,NULL,91,'2026-04-24 17:40:25.938086',7),(42,_binary '','2026-04-24 17:40:26.536186','Cast iron hex dumbbell set with an anti-roll design. Includes a textured steel handle for secure grip. Perfect for home gym strength training and muscle building.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576678927484-cc907957088c?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w5MzQzMTh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxEdW1iYmVsbHN8ZW58MHx8fHwxNzc3MDUyNDI2fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080',_binary '\0','Hex Adjustable Dumbbell Set 15kg',3499,NULL,28,'2026-04-24 17:40:26.536186',7),(43,_binary '','2026-04-24 17:40:26.988513','Set of 5 stackable resistance tube bands. Includes handles, ankle straps, and a door anchor. Provides up to 150 lbs of resistance for full-body home workouts.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584827386916-b5351d3ba34b?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w5MzQzMTh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxSZXNpc3RhbmNlJTIwQmFuZHN8ZW58MHx8fHwxNzc3MDUyNDI2fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080',_binary '\0','Heavy Duty Resistance Bands Set',1299,NULL,149,'2026-04-24 17:40:26.988513',7),(44,_binary '','2026-04-24 17:40:27.551815','Solid cast iron kettlebell with a wide, comfortable grip handle. Flat bottom prevents rolling. Excellent for swings, deadlifts, squats, and functional training.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1632077804406-188472f1a810?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w5MzQzMTh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxLZXR0bGViZWxsfGVufDB8fHx8MTc3NzA1MjQyN3ww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080',_binary '\0','Cast Iron Kettlebell 8kg',1899,NULL,91,'2026-04-24 17:40:27.551815',7),(45,_binary '','2026-04-24 17:40:28.111360','1000W high-speed digital blender perfect for smoothies, ice crushing, and hot soups. Comes with a 1.5L BPA-free Tritan jar and 6 stainless steel blades.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1715249891414-9c531b63b031?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w5MzQzMTh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxLaXRjaGVuJTIwQmxlbmRlcnxlbnwwfHx8fDE3NzcwNTI0Mjd8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080',_binary '\0','AeroBlend Pro Digital Blender',4299,NULL,91,'2026-04-24 17:40:28.111360',8),(46,_binary '','2026-04-24 17:40:28.717481','Oil-free digital air fryer with 8 preset cooking modes. Cook crispy fries, chicken, and vegetables with 85% less fat. Features a non-stick, dishwasher-safe basket.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1695089028114-ce28248f0ab9?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w5MzQzMTh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxBaXIlMjBGcnllcnxlbnwwfHx8fDE3NzcwNTI0Mjh8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080',_binary '\0','HealthyFry 5L Air Fryer',5999,NULL,135,'2026-04-24 17:40:28.717481',8),(47,_binary '','2026-04-24 17:40:29.410620','Heavy-duty cast iron skillet for exceptional heat retention and even cooking. Pre-seasoned with vegetable oil. Safe for stovetop, oven, and campfire cooking.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1567954046925-780ec4ab0157?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w5MzQzMTh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxDYXN0JTIwSXJvbiUyMFNraWxsZXR8ZW58MHx8fHwxNzc3MDUyNDI5fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080',_binary '\0','Pre-Seasoned Cast Iron Skillet 10-inch',1499,NULL,82,'2026-04-24 17:40:29.410620',8),(48,_binary '','2026-04-24 17:40:29.979495','A Handbook of Agile Software Craftsmanship. A must-read for any software developer aiming to write robust, maintainable, and clean code. Contains practical examples in Java.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580121441575-41bcb5c6b47c?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w5MzQzMTh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxQcm9ncmFtbWluZyUyMEJvb2t8ZW58MHx8fHwxNzc3MDUyNDI5fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080',_binary '\0','Clean Code by Robert C. Martin',650,NULL,114,'2026-04-24 17:40:29.979495',9),(49,_binary '','2026-04-24 17:40:30.558521','An Easy & Proven Way to Build Good Habits & Break Bad Ones. This transformative book teaches you practical strategies to form good habits, break bad ones, and master tiny behaviors.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1546913760-e23d946dd386?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w5MzQzMTh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxTZWxmJTIwSGVscCUyMEJvb2t8ZW58MHx8fHwxNzc3MDUyNDMwfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080',_binary '\0','Atomic Habits by James Clear',499,NULL,60,'2026-04-24 17:40:30.558521',9),(50,_binary '','2026-04-24 17:40:31.267225','Your journey to mastery. This classic programming book covers topics ranging from personal responsibility and career development to architectural techniques for building resilient code.','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1484665739383-a1069a82d4be?crop=entropy&cs=tinysrgb&fit=max&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w5MzQzMTh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxTb2Z0d2FyZSUyMEVuZ2luZWVyaW5nJTIwQm9va3xlbnwwfHx8fDE3NzcwNTI0MzF8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=80&w=1080',_binary '\0','The Pragmatic Programmer',850,NULL,59,'2026-04-24 17:40:31.267225',9),(51,_binary '','2026-04-24 17:40:31.596671','A magical fable about following your dream. This enchanting story tells the magical journey of Santiago, an Andalusian shepherd boy who yearns to travel in search of a worldly treasure.','/images/placeholder-product.jpg',_binary '\0','The Alchemist by Paulo Coelho',299,NULL,20,'2026-04-24 17:40:31.596671',9);
